      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "reserve (\"allocate\") memory:\n\n1)\nz->size += extra_space;  // increase zone size\n\n2)\nz_new = malloc(struct zone);\nz_new->start = start_address;\nz_new->size = extra_space;\nz_new->permissions = zone_perm;\nadd_zone_to_vas(pvas_head, z_new);",
